{"audio": "revelation-15.opus", "duration_ms": 81704, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 2181, "end_ms": 3641, "text": "Revelation, Chapter Fifteen."}, {"start_ms": 4861, "end_ms": 13184, "text": "Then I saw another great and marvelous sign in heaven: seven angels with the seven final plagues, with which the wrath of God is completed."}, {"start_ms": 14024, "end_ms": 22147, "text": "And I saw something like a sea of glass mixed with fire, beside which stood those who had conquered the beast and its image and the number of its name."}, {"start_ms": 22747, "end_ms": 32550, "text": "They were holding harps from God, and they sang the song of God’s servant Moses and of the Lamb: “Great and wonderful are Your works, O Lord God Almighty!"}, {"start_ms": 33130, "end_ms": 36131, "text": "Just and true are Your ways, O King of the nations!"}, {"start_ms": 36731, "end_ms": 39652, "text": "Who will not fear You, O Lord, and glorify Your name?"}, {"start_ms": 40192, "end_ms": 41492, "text": "For You alone are holy."}, {"start_ms": 42112, "end_ms": 53116, "text": "All nations will come and worship before You, for Your righteous acts have been revealed.” After this I looked, and the temple—the tabernacle of the Testimony—was opened in heaven."}, {"start_ms": 53736, "end_ms": 62218, "text": "And out of the temple came the seven angels with the seven plagues, dressed in clean and bright linen and girded with golden sashes around their chests."}, {"start_ms": 63219, "end_ms": 70341, "text": "Then one of the four living creatures gave the seven angels seven golden bowls full of the wrath of God, who lives forever and ever."}, {"start_ms": 71281, "end_ms": 80464, "text": "And the temple was filled with smoke from the glory of God and from His power; and no one could enter the temple until the seven plagues of the seven angels were completed."}], "words": [{"t": "Revelation,", "s": 2181, "e": 2701, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2841, "e": 3141, "si": 0}, {"t": "Fifteen.", "s": 3241, "e": 364